@* 對照表：欄位由資料宣告，表格的標記交給共用的 DataTable；第一欄是列首，最後一欄是依據。 *@
<div class="ep-ans-table-section">
    <AnswerHeading Text="@Block.Title" />
    <DataTable Items="Block.Rows" Columns="_columns" Label="@(Block.Title ?? L["資料表格"])" Plain="true" />
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public ComparisonTableBlock Block { get; set; } = null!;

    private ComparisonTableBlock? _columnsFor;
    private IReadOnlyList<ColumnDef<ComparisonRow>> _columns = [];

    protected override void OnParametersSet()
    {
        // 同一個積木不重建欄位：DataTable 看到新的清單就會當作變了。
        if (ReferenceEquals(_columnsFor, Block))
            return;

        _columnsFor = Block;
        _columns =
        [
            .. Block.Columns.Select((title, index) => new ColumnDef<ComparisonRow>
            {
                Title = title,
                Labeled = index != 0,
                Class = index == 0 ? "ep-keep" : null,
                Cell = row => builder => builder.AddContent(0, index < row.Cells.Count ? row.Cells[index] : null),
            }),
            new ColumnDef<ComparisonRow>
            {
                Title = L["依據"],
                Cell = row => @<CitationChips Codes="row.CitationCodes" />,
            },
        ];
    }
}
